  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OMCT CIVIL SOCIETY UNITED AGAINST TORTURE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">prevention and greater accountability for torture globally and in 25 countries, working with national CSOs toward the implementation of the Convention Against Torture through a three-tier approach: 1. Engaging CSOs in challenging environments and countries with systematic torture; 2. Mobilising CSOs and other stakeholders (journalists) to engage with the UN Committee Against Torture (CAT) in a process supporting change; 3. Legal accountability actions for torture through litigation groups and urgent assistance to victims, including groups most vulnerable to torture (women, migrants, children, etc.).</narrative>
  </description>
